{"Grant-type validation in isAccessTokenId matcher uses wrong substring indices (3-5 instead of 4-5) to extract the grant shortcut from the 6-character prefix, and incorrectly returns false when the substring equals the expected grant shortcut instead of when it differs.": 0.9851505160331726, "Introducing a new abstract method getShortcut() on OAuth2GrantTypeFactory SPI interface breaks binary compatibility - existing custom grant type factories compiled against the previous version will throw AbstractMethodError when the runtime calls this new method. Should add a default implementation delegating to getId().": 0.9479418992996216, "Test instantiates DefaultTokenContextEncoderProviderFactory without initializing sessionFactory, so when parsing a token with an unknown grant shortcut, getGrantTypeByShortcut dereferences null sessionFactory and throws NullPointerException instead of the intended IllegalArgumentException. Test silently accepts this wrong exception.": 0.8039923906326294}